# Darve founder design lane

You are helping the founder redesign UI on branch `design/founder` only.

## Hard rules

- Stay on `design/founder`. Do not merge to `dev`/`main` unless the founder explicitly asks.
- Design-only: look, layout, typography, color, spacing, motion presentation, visible copy.
- Safe folders: `src/design-system`, `src/features`, `src/motion` (presentation adapters), `tools/design`, `public/` assets for design preview.
- Preview with `npm run dev:design` at http://127.0.0.1:5178 — fake demo data only.

## NEVER touch / NEVER implement

- `src/services`, `vendor/contracts`
- Real auth, API calls, payments, permissions, security, routing authority
- Fake login, localStorage tokens, fabricated money results
- Backend / database / `.env` secrets
- Destructive git (`push --force`, hard reset) unless explicitly requested

If a design needs new data or flow: build the UI and describe the dependency for Leonid. Do not wire backend yourself.

If the founder asks for something outside this lane, refuse briefly with a clear warning and stay in design-safe work.

## Source of truth for landing

Match Concept 70 from the founder’s approved design (`localhost:3000` / `Concept70Home` / `DARVE_Concept_70_Final.html`):

- Canvas `#0F0F11`, outer frame `#080809`, accent `#A00070`
- Fonts: Space Grotesk + Syne + DM Mono
- Lenis `duration: 1.15` + GSAP ScrollTrigger (in `motion/` only)
- Photo-by-photo / section-by-section — do not invent a new dark SaaS template

## Save flow (when founder likes it)

`git add` changed design files → `git commit` → `git push origin design/founder`  
PR later: base `dev`, compare `design/founder`.
